cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use fast-beagle, cite this software and the Beagle papers
  listed under references.
type: software
title: "fast-beagle 5.4"
abstract: >-
  Fast standalone C port of Beagle 5.4 genotype phasing and imputation,
  with output byte-identical to the Java release run with the same
  nthreads. Adds BGEN v1.2 output and a tabix index written in the same
  pass as the VCF.
authors:
  - family-names: Denyer
    given-names: Michael
version: 5.4.1
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/michael-denyer/fast-beagle-5.4"
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - genomics
  - phasing
  - imputation
  - beagle
  - vcf
  - bgen
